WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.556 --> 00:00:17.816
looked so worried that Helene ran over to him.

2
00:00:17.836 --> 00:00:19.377
"What's wrong?"

3
00:00:19.937 --> 00:00:20.437
she said.

4
00:00:21.718 --> 00:00:22.738
Vinnie explained.

5
00:00:22.758 --> 00:00:27.319
"I have to keep the soup away from the king," he cried.

6
00:00:27.339 --> 00:00:30.620
"I'll help," said Helene.

7
00:00:31.560 --> 00:00:34.463
They followed the servant carrying the tray of soup.

8
00:00:35.684 --> 00:00:39.347
In the palace, Mandy was still searching for Helene.

9
00:00:40.588 --> 00:00:42.509
She walked down another hallway.

10
00:00:43.890 --> 00:00:44.911
She heard noises.

11
00:00:47.013 --> 00:00:49.515
Quietly she opened the nearest door.

12
00:00:50.676 --> 00:00:52.938
The room was full of billiard tables.

13
00:00:53.679 --> 00:00:56.020
Men, including King Louis, were playing.

14
00:00:56.041 --> 00:01:00.104
"Oh, Your Majesty," one man laughed.

15
00:01:01.324 --> 00:01:02.184
"You win again!

16
00:01:02.584 --> 00:01:04.745
You are truly the champion of this game."

17
00:01:06.005 --> 00:01:07.326
King Louis smiled.

18
00:01:07.986 --> 00:01:10.046
Then he walked into the next room.

19
00:01:11.407 --> 00:01:13.908
Mandy followed, keeping out of sight.

20
00:01:14.768 --> 00:01:17.248
It was a dining room with a long table.

21
00:01:18.329 --> 00:01:20.669
Waiting servants held trays of food.

22
00:01:20.689 --> 00:01:22.890
"Bring me my soup!"

23
00:01:23.610 --> 00:01:25.371
said the king as he sat down.

24
00:01:26.591 --> 00:01:30.112
Mandy saw her brother and Helene right behind the servants.

25
00:01:30.844 --> 00:01:31.985
They looked scared.

26
00:01:33.166 --> 00:01:35.687
Mandy waved, but they didn't see her.

27
00:01:35.708 --> 00:01:38.650
"Ah, my favorite soup!"

28
00:01:39.350 --> 00:01:40.231
the king said.

29
00:01:44.614 --> 00:01:46.835
At that moment, Vinnie jumped out.

30
00:01:46.855 --> 00:01:48.857
"Don't eat that!"

31
00:01:49.297 --> 00:01:49.917
he yelled.

32
00:01:51.098 --> 00:01:54.761
Startled, the servant dropped the soup into the king's lap.

33
00:01:54.781 --> 00:01:56.902
"You idiot!"

34
00:01:57.583 --> 00:01:59.404
King Louis leaped from his seat.

35
00:02:00.664 --> 00:02:02.285
"Your Majesty, are you all right?"

36
00:02:02.965 --> 00:02:03.905
cried the servant.

37
00:02:04.605 --> 00:02:06.126
Everyone ran to the king.

38
00:02:07.046 --> 00:02:09.387
They tried to wipe off the spilled soup.

39
00:02:09.407 --> 00:02:12.067
"Vinnie! Helene!"

40
00:02:12.648 --> 00:02:14.088
Mandy shouted loudly.

41
00:02:15.368 --> 00:02:16.269
They ran to her.

42
00:02:16.289 --> 00:02:18.449
"We'd better get away!"

43
00:02:19.049 --> 00:02:19.990
Helene cried.

44
00:02:20.010 --> 00:02:24.351
"Oh, look at the royal clothing," said someone.

45
00:02:24.371 --> 00:02:27.732
"His coat is ruined," said another.

46
00:02:29.172 --> 00:02:32.334
"And his best hat," a servant whispered.

47
00:02:32.354 --> 00:02:33.715
"What a mess!"

48
00:02:34.976 --> 00:02:38.218
The king looked up and screamed: "That boy!

49
00:02:38.519 --> 00:02:38.999
Stop him!"

50
00:02:40.320 --> 00:02:41.541
Everyone looked around.

51
00:02:42.221 --> 00:02:44.843
In the confusion, the children had escaped.

52
00:02:46.324 --> 00:02:48.746
The children ran down a long hallway.

53
00:02:48.766 --> 00:02:50.067
"Over here!"

54
00:02:50.667 --> 00:02:51.508
cried Helene.

55
00:02:52.929 --> 00:02:55.230
They stopped to catch their breath in a corner.

56
00:02:56.131 --> 00:02:57.652
The guards were far behind.

57
00:02:58.876 --> 00:03:00.397
Vinnie pulled out the photo.

58
00:03:00.417 --> 00:03:05.241
"We have to get to a fountain with golden frogs," he said.

59
00:03:05.261 --> 00:03:09.444
"You must mean the Fountain of Latona," said Helene.

60
00:03:09.464 --> 00:03:11.705
"It has many frogs on it.

61
00:03:12.626 --> 00:03:13.767
It's behind the palace.

62
00:03:14.167 --> 00:03:14.868
I'll show you."

63
00:03:15.608 --> 00:03:16.929
The children followed her.

64
00:03:19.951 --> 00:03:24.114
Along the way Mandy asked: "Why did you stop King Louis?"

65
00:03:24.835 --> 00:03:25.896
Vinnie explained.

66
00:03:27.048 --> 00:03:30.211
"Would the king really kill someone because of his soup?"

67
00:03:30.811 --> 00:03:31.532
asked Mandy.

68
00:03:31.552 --> 00:03:35.075
"Only if it was truly poisoned!"

69
00:03:35.696 --> 00:03:36.576
laughed Helene.

70
00:03:36.596 --> 00:03:38.178
"Look, Mandy!

71
00:03:38.558 --> 00:03:41.000
The frogs in the picture are glowing blue!"

72
00:03:41.641 --> 00:03:42.542
Vinnie shouted.

73
00:03:42.562 --> 00:03:45.504
"What?" asked Helene.

74
00:03:45.524 --> 00:03:48.106
"Nothing," said Mandy.

75
00:03:48.126 --> 00:03:51.449
"There it is!"

76
00:03:52.070 --> 00:03:53.451
Helene pointed ahead.

77
00:03:55.348 --> 00:03:58.270
"The fountain was inspired by an ancient Greek goddess.

78
00:03:59.191 --> 00:04:01.813
She turned people into frogs if they insulted her."

79
00:04:01.833 --> 00:04:06.437
"Wow, sounds cruel," gulped Vinnie.

80
00:04:07.318 --> 00:04:08.399
Helene giggled.

81
00:04:08.419 --> 00:04:16.005
"Some people think King Louis built it to send his people a message: obey your king!

82
00:04:17.065 --> 00:04:18.847
Anyway, I have to get back to work.

83
00:04:19.287 --> 00:04:19.908
See you later?"

84
00:04:21.049 --> 00:04:22.550
Mandy gave her a hug.

85
00:04:22.570 --> 00:04:27.193
"Well good-bye," she said, then paused.

86
00:04:27.213 --> 00:04:30.035
"I am so glad I met you!"

87
00:04:30.916 --> 00:04:32.537
Helene looked confused.

88
00:04:33.638 --> 00:04:37.160
When Vinnie and Mandy got to the fountain, they looked back.

89
00:04:38.181 --> 00:04:40.923
Helene was walking up the steps waving.

90
00:04:42.344 --> 00:04:45.506
The grand Palace of Versailles was as beautiful as ever.

91
00:04:45.526 --> 00:04:50.410
"The frogs are glowing red," said Vinnie.

92
00:04:50.430 --> 00:04:51.971
"We're going home."
